T2  Rank-deficient coefficient equivalence
==============================================================================
  null space of Phi_ref has dimension 4
  ||eta_aux2 - eta_aux|| = 3.700e+00   ||Phi(eta_aux2 - eta_aux)|| = 6.541e-16
  lstsq solution vs pinv solution: ||d coef|| = 7.416e+01   ||d projected write|| = 2.440e+00
